Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:46:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound passive timer exemption by observed probe
 custody

Preserve overdue timer recovery for never-observed local executors and split-custody rows masking remote silence. Recheck memo at observation expiry. Proof: seven custody controls (two reproduced red before fix), 53 predicate cases; mutation audit 43 killed plus one equivalent redundant blank-command guard. Independent prepublication review found no remaining issues. Exact-head CI/review and deployment remain required.
